cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper below."
title: "DCEBE: Bolus arrival time estimation for DCE-MRI signals"
abstract: "Reference MATLAB implementation of a spline-based model for estimating the bolus arrival time of dynamic contrast-enhanced MRI (DCE-MRI) signals. Particularly intended for signals without a fast upslope, as commonly seen in small-animal data. Parameters are selected via generalised cross-validation."
